# Rust build artifacts (root workspace + standalone component/crate workspaces)
**/target/
Cargo-component.lock

# Foundry
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
contracts/broadcast/

# Node / TypeScript
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
poa.env

# WAVS deploy runtime artifacts (all regenerated by deploy/deploy.sh)
wavs.toml
service.json
deploy/components/*.wasm
.nodes/
.docker/

# Misc
.DS_Store

# NOTE: components/*/wit/deps is intentionally VENDORED, not ignored. Unlike
# priime-pools (which re-fetches WIT via clone-wit-repo + a wkg registry config),
# this demo is self-contained: `wkg wit fetch` cannot resolve wasi:tls (draft) or
# the custom wavs:types packages from the public registry, so the deps must ship.
